            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Just realised that I could achieve the same look with `MiniTablineCurrent` and `MiniTablineModifiedCurrent` by using following attribute \r\n```lua\r\n{underline = true, sp = \"#f38ba8\"}\r\n```",
