        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Also if you don't mind giving me an advice how to get color for tabline icons. Not sure if it's worth a new feature request :)\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, this is not currently possible by design. Mostly because initially there were no icons at all to fit more tabs, but they proved to be useful, so I added them. Having it the same color as text makes a more coherent look with 'mini.statusline'.\r\n\r\nIf this is crucial for you, feel free to open an issue about it. But even if implemented, it would use highlighting from 'nvim-web-devicons'. ",
